        "apps/desktop/src/store/**",
        "apps/desktop/src/i18n/**",
        "apps/desktop/e2e/**",
        "tests-js/**"
      ],
      "requires_approved_contract": false,
      "note": "Sidebar restructure: an action row (new task, search via the existing command palette), a group-by switch limited to dimensions that have real data (project, recent), and a two-level project-to-session list with per-row relative time and a status dot. Built from existing shadcn/radix and repository components - no new dependency, since a sidebar is not a conversational component. Existing behaviour (reorder, drag, load more, filter menu, context menu, profile and connection switching) is preserved with its tests. Unread uses a client-local cursor and is labelled as local visibility rather than a server fact; the plugin market from the reference is not built because no backend surface exists."
    },
