      "note": "Composer input bar only: keep the profile selector, add a provider/model selector, render the profile's declared controls dynamically (reuse the existing renderer), a permission chip only when the backend declares such a control, and a context-usage container that shows unknown unless the backend supplies real data (estimation is forbidden). Adopt an external copy-in component library for the shapes with a licence check; consume the locked wire only - no wire or backend changes."
